#: ../../source/users/element/collection/project_collection.rst:5
msgid "Project collection"
msgstr "项目集合"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/project_collection.rst:7
msgid ""
"The project collection is the only collection which is not part from the "
"software structure. A project collection is an element collection that is "
"part of the project file, each `project`_ has its own element collection."
msgstr "项目集合是唯一不属于软件结构的集合。项目集合是项目文件的一部分，每个 `项目 <project_>`_ 都有各自的元件集合。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/project_collection.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech project collection"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目集合"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/project_collection.rst:16
msgid ""
"QElectroTech does not allow working in this collection, the user cannot add "
"or delete any element, category or sub-category manually. The user can only "
"read the category or sub-category properties and use the collection to "
"access to the `elements`_ of the `project`_ to edit them."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 不允许在该集合中进行操作，用户无法手动添加或删除任何元件、类别或子类别。用户只能读取类别或子类别的属性，并通过该集合访问 "
"`项目 <project_>`_ 的 `元件 <elements_>`_ 以进行编辑。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/project_collection.rst:20
msgid ""
"The elements are copied from `QET`_ or `User`_ collection by QElectroTech "
"automatically when the user introduces a new `element`_ at one `folio`_ of "
"the `project`_. If the `element`_ has already been used previously, "
"QElectroTech does not add the `element`_ to the project collection again."
msgstr ""
"当用户在 `项目 <project_>`_ 的某个 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 中插入新 `元件 <element_>`_ "
"时，QElectroTech 会自动从 `QET 集合 <QET_>`_ 或 `用户集合 <User_>`_ 中复制这些元件。如果该 `元件 "
"<element_>`_ 此前已经使用过，QElectroTech 不会再次将 `元件 <element_>`_ 添加到项目集合中。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/project_collection.rst:24
msgid ""
"If one `element`_ is deleted from the `project`_, QElectroTech does not "
"delete the `element`_ from the project collection automatically, the "
"`element`_ is remarked in red. `Cleaning the project`_ deletes all elements "
"from the project collection that are not used inside the project and reduces"
" the size of the project file."
msgstr ""
"如果从 `项目 <project_>`_ 中删除某个 `元件 <element_>`_，QElectroTech 不会自动从项目集合中删除该 `元件 "
"<element_>`_，而是将该 `元件 <element_>`_ 标记为红色。`清理项目 <Cleaning the project_>`_ "
"会删除项目集合中未在项目内使用的所有元件，并减小项目文件的大小。"
